<%# The stream source and the morphed refresh for a page that switches to the results at the reveal (spec 025 D1, D2). The signed name carries the
    number of the phase the page is drawn for, so ResultsChannel can refresh a phone that missed the reveal (spec 024 D10). locals: game, phase %>
<% turbo_refreshes_with method: :morph, scroll: :preserve %>
<%= turbo_stream_from :results, game.public_id, phase.number, channel: ResultsChannel %>
